    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2079914044425658739",
      "url": "https://x.com/georgeprobook/status/2079914044425658739",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/georgeprobook/status/2079914044425658739",
      "text": "The best endorsement we've ever gotten came from someone who was trying to prove us wrong.\n\nAnthony Plumbing, Heating, Cooling & Electric runs about 170 technicians across the Kansas City metro. When we showed up, their dispatch manager, Jessie Parker, wasn't interested in being sold. She'd been burned by dispatch automation before, so she went looking for the cracks in ours, stress-testing it and waiting for it to fall over the way the last one did.\n\nIt didn't. Our team went on-site and worked closely with Jessie and the Anthony team to tune Probook the way they actually run. A year in, here's where she landed: \"Probook is our best trained dispatcher on the team as far as I'm concerned.\"\n\nThe numbers reflected it too. Anthony went from 16 dispatchers to 8 while covering the same ~170 techs, nearly doubling how many technicians each dispatcher supports. Average ticket, which had been down almost 10% year over year before @probookai, turned positive within 90 days, a net 20% swing in the positive.\n\nCaleb Seyer and the Anthony team are of the sharpest operators I know, and winning over their toughest skeptic is a personal milestone I won't forget. Thank you for betting on us. Full story in comments.",
